@startuml
title Example 7 - DEFENSE ON does not stop real work: Marcus's $139 refund
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #F2F6FA
  BorderColor #1F4E79
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
  BorderColor #1F4E79
}
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #1F4E79
  GroupBorderColor #1F4E79
  GroupHeaderFontColor #1F4E79
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #9E9D24
}
actor "Support agent\n(presenter)" as P
participant "ShopDeskAgent\nagent.py" as A
participant "Defense\ndefense.py" as D #E8F5E9
participant "LLM" as M
participant "presenter.py\ndo_resume()" as UI
participant "tools/impl.py\nissue_refund()" as TL
P -> A : "Process Marcus Oyelaran's refund for the returned shoes"\nLEVEL 3, DEFENSE ON
A -> M : DEFENDED prompt + fenced tickets
M --> A : tool_use issue_refund(order_id="A1021", amount=139, reason="return received")
A -> D : check_tool_call(issue_refund)
D -> D : _policy(): A1021 exists, $139 <= $139 left,\nstatus 'returned' -> passes
D --> A : approve - issue_refund is irreversible
A --> P : run.status = awaiting_approval\napproval box: issue_refund {"order_id": "A1021", "amount": 139 ...}
alt Presenter clicks Approve
  P -> UI : do_resume(run, True)
  UI -> A : ctx.agent(run.level, run.defense).resume(run, approved=True)\n(the fresh Defense takes run.scope)
  A -> TL : _execute() -> log_refund("A1021", 139)
  TL --> P : trace: "Support agent APPROVED issue_refund"\n"SIMULATED issue_refund -> $139.00 on order A1021"
else Presenter clicks Deny
  P -> UI : do_resume(run, False)
  UI -> A : resume(run, approved=False)
  A --> P : trace: "Support agent DENIED issue_refund"
end
A -> M : tool result, model finishes the summary
note over D, TL
  A second $139 refund on A1021 is refused: nothing is left on the order.
end note
@enduml
